%% SongLink · 手机点歌端到端时序
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Rmt as 手机 Remote
  participant Host as PC Host
  participant Ad as 音乐 App 适配器
  participant App as 目标 App
  participant SMTC as SMTC(真值源)
  participant Lyr as LyricService

  Rmt->>Host: {cmd:pick, "晴天"}
  Host->>Ad: PlayByQuery(晴天, 周杰伦)
  Ad->>App: 搜索框输入 / 回车 / 点结果(UIA·OCR·私有)
  App-->>SMTC: 开始播放，session 切换
  SMTC-->>Host: CurrentChanged + PlaybackPosition
  Host-->>Rmt: ack(c-17, ok) + state{晴天, pos}
  Host->>Lyr: 用 title+artist 匹配/拉取 LRC
  Lyr-->>Host: 歌词时间轴
  Host-->>Rmt: lyric[]（整首一次下发）
  Note over Rmt: 本地按 pos 平滑滚词 + 封面显示